---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="工作台"
  description="大学生方程式车队时期的建模与后来的 PCB、工程图:可旋转、可点选杆件的 E32 车架 3D,蓝色板底带元器件的电路板 3D。已退役,留作记录。"
>
  <section class="page-head container-prose" data-reveal="focus">
    <p class="eyebrow">WORKBENCH</p>
    <h1><span class="grad">工作台</span></h1>
    <p class="desc">
      视觉代码之外,我动手做的部分。大学生方程式车队(车架组)时期攒下的建模和仿真,退役前后的 PCB 和工程图——不是主线,但机器人是软硬一体的,这些最终都会回到机器人上。
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--gray" style="margin-top:2.6rem;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal="focus">
        <p class="eyebrow">TIMELINE</p>
        <h2>这几年都做了什么</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="card bench-note" data-reveal="focus">
        <ul class="bench-timeline">
          <li>
            <span class="t">2025.10 – 2025.12</span>
            <div><strong>方程式车队 · 车架组(CATIA)</strong>练零件建模,画了 20 多个零件,最后一个完整的 E32 车架,导出 STEP 进 ANSYS 做了仿真。</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="t">2026.01 – 2026.03</span>
            <div><strong>PCB(立创EDA)</strong>51 单片机核心板、STM32F103VET6 开发板、一块窄长练习板,导出 gerber;USB 拓展坞画了一半。</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="t">2026.01 – 2026.07</span>
            <div><strong>NX (UG) 零件与工装</strong>从 model 练习件到合页、铰链板、夹具、推车、钢板,20 多个 .prt;7 月给车队画了举升器的整套工装(上/下支撑架、夹具),全套 STEP 和方管切割下料的 CAD 出图都在。</div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="t">2026.08 底</span>
            <div><strong>退出车队</strong>方程式的事到这个夏天告一段落,这些模型、板子和图纸留在这里当记录。</div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal="focus">
        <p class="eyebrow">PCB</p>
        <h2>画过的板子</h2>
        <p class="sub">从立创EDA 的原理图到布局布线,再导出 gerber。布线图直接从 gerber 文件分层渲染(红=顶层铜,蓝=底层铜,白=丝印),不是软件截图。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bench-grid bench-grid--two" data-reveal-group>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/pcb2d-mcu51.png" alt="51 单片机核心板布线图:红色顶层铜、蓝色底层铜、白色丝印" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>51 单片机核心板</strong>
            <span>2026.01 · 70×40 mm</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/pcb2d-stm32.png" alt="STM32F103VET6 开发板布线图:双排引脚、USB、SWD 调试口" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>STM32F103VET6 开发板</strong>
            <span>2026.02 · 100×80 mm</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/pcb2d-pcb1.png" alt="窄长型练习板布线图" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>PCB1 · 窄长练习板</strong>
            <span>2026.01 · 100×30 mm</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="viewer3d-card" data-reveal="focus">
        <div class="viewer3d-head">
          <strong>PCB 3D · 蓝色板底 + 元器件(KiCad 官方模型)</strong>
          <span class="pcb-tabs" role="tablist">
            <button class="pcb-tab is-active" data-pcb-tab="mcu51">51 核心板</button>
            <button class="pcb-tab" data-pcb-tab="stm32">STM32</button>
            <button class="pcb-tab" data-pcb-tab="pcb1">PCB1</button>
          </span>
          <span class="viewer3d-tip">拖动旋转 · 滚轮缩放</span>
        </div>
        <div class="viewer3d" data-viewer="pcb" data-pcb="mcu51"
             data-tex="/images/workbench/pcb3d-mcu51-tex.png"
             data-json="/models/pcb3d-mcu51.json"
             data-tex-stm32="/images/workbench/pcb3d-stm32-tex.png" data-json-stm32="/models/pcb3d-stm32.json"
             data-tex-pcb1="/images/workbench/pcb3d-pcb1-tex.png" data-json-pcb1="/models/pcb3d-pcb1.json">
          <div class="viewer3d-hint">正在加载 3D 视图…</div>
          <canvas aria-label="PCB 可旋转 3D 视图,蓝色板底与元器件"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--gray">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal="focus">
        <p class="eyebrow">3D MODELS</p>
        <h2>车架与工装</h2>
        <p class="sub">都可以拖动旋转、滚轮缩放;<strong>点击杆件会高亮并显示件号</strong>,和建模软件里的选中一个意思。模型由 CATIA / NX 导出的 STEP 转成网格,按原始实体逐件分组。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="viewer3d-card" data-reveal="focus">
        <div class="viewer3d-head">
          <strong>E32 车架 · 方程式车队车架组</strong>
          <span>CATIA 建模 · 2025.12 · 101 个实体 · 轴距方向约 2.3 m</span>
        </div>
        <div class="viewer3d viewer3d--tall" data-viewer="glb" data-src="/models/frame-e32.glb" data-pick="1">
          <div class="viewer3d-hint">正在加载 3D 视图…</div>
          <div class="viewer3d-label" hidden></div>
          <canvas aria-label="E32 车架可旋转 3D 视图,点击杆件选中"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="viewer3d-card" style="margin-top:1.4rem;" data-reveal="focus">
        <div class="viewer3d-head">
          <strong>举升器工装 · NX 设计</strong>
          <span>2026.07 · 33 个实体 · 上/下支撑架与夹具</span>
        </div>
        <div class="viewer3d" data-viewer="glb" data-src="/models/jack.glb" data-pick="1">
          <div class="viewer3d-hint">正在加载 3D 视图…</div>
          <div class="viewer3d-label" hidden></div>
          <canvas aria-label="举升器工装可旋转 3D 视图,点击零件选中"></canvas>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="bench-grid bench-grid--two" style="margin-top:1.4rem;">
        <div class="viewer3d-card" data-reveal="focus">
          <div class="viewer3d-head">
            <strong>铰链板 · NX</strong>
            <span>2026.04 · STEP</span>
          </div>
          <div class="viewer3d" data-viewer="stl" data-src="/models/jiaolian.stl" data-color="steel">
            <div class="viewer3d-hint">正在加载 3D 视图…</div>
            <canvas aria-label="铰链板可旋转 3D 视图"></canvas>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="viewer3d-card" data-reveal="focus">
          <div class="viewer3d-head">
            <strong>仿真几何 · ANSYS</strong>
            <span>2026.07 · 车架仿真工程里的板件与杆件</span>
          </div>
          <div class="viewer3d" data-viewer="stl" data-src="/models/model-731.stl" data-color="steel">
            <div class="viewer3d-hint">正在加载 3D 视图…</div>
            <canvas aria-label="仿真几何可旋转 3D 视图"></canvas>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card bench-note" style="margin-top:1.4rem;" data-reveal="focus">
        <h3 class="bench-note-title">关于 NX 和 SolidWorks 的文件</h3>
        <p class="bench-note-text">
          车架的 NX 版(chejia.prt)和夹具、推车、合页等 20 多个 .prt 是私有格式,浏览器渲染不了;
          上面只放导出过 STEP 的部分——车架的 CATIA 版、举升器全套工装、铰链板和仿真几何。
          SolidWorks 装了,还没有正式的模型文件。等有新的 STEP 导出,我会继续补进来。
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head" data-reveal="focus">
        <p class="eyebrow">CAD DRAWING</p>
        <h2>CAD 出图 · 举升器工装下料</h2>
        <p class="sub">给举升器工装画的整套方管切割下料图,从 DWG 出图直接转换渲染,几何原样。DWG 里的标题栏文字和尺寸标注没有随转换保留,图框和图样都在。</p>
      </div>
      <div class="bench-grid bench-grid--two" data-reveal-group>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/drawing-fixture.svg" alt="支撑架夹具方管下料图:带孔位中心标的管件展开图" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>支撑架夹具 · 方管下料</strong>
            <span>2026.07 · DWG 出图</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/drawing-cross.svg" alt="交叉管下料展开图:两根交叉管的切割图样" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>交叉管 · 下料展开</strong>
            <span>2026.07 · DWG 出图</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/drawing-cut-1.svg" alt="梯形管下料展开图:带孔位中心标" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>梯形管 · 下料展开(带孔位)</strong>
            <span>2026.07 · DWG 出图</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="bench-card">
          <div class="bench-stage">
            <img src="/images/workbench/drawing-cut-2.svg" alt="梯形管下料展开图:另一规格" loading="lazy" />
          </div>
          <figcaption>
            <strong>方管下料 · 另一规格</strong>
            <span>2026.07 · DWG 出图</span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

<script>
  import * as THREE from 'three';
  import { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';
  import { STLLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/STLLoader.js';
  import { GLTFLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/GLTFLoader.js';
  import { VRMLLoader } from 'three/addons/loaders/VRMLLoader.js';

  function makeViewer(holder) {
    const canvas = holder.querySelector('canvas');
    const hint = holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-hint');
    let renderer;
    try {
      renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, antialias: true, alpha: true });
    } catch (e) {
      hint.textContent = '当前浏览器不支持 WebGL,3D 视图无法显示。';
      return null;
    }
    renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2));
    const scene = new THREE.Scene();
    const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(38, 1, 0.001, 100);
    scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff, 0x50555c, 1.1));
    const key = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff, 1.6);
    key.position.set(3, 5, 4);
    scene.add(key);
    const fill = new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xdde3ff, 0.5);
    fill.position.set(-4, -2, -3);
    scene.add(fill);

    const controls = new OrbitControls(camera, canvas);
    controls.enableDamping = true;
    controls.dampingFactor = 0.08;

    function resize() {
      const w = holder.clientWidth || 600;
      const h = holder.clientHeight || 400;
      renderer.setSize(w, h, false);
      camera.aspect = w / h;
      camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
    }
    new ResizeObserver(resize).observe(holder);
    resize();

    let visible = true;
    new IntersectionObserver((es) => { visible = es.some((e) => e.isIntersecting); }).observe(holder);
    (function loop() {
      requestAnimationFrame(loop);
      if (!visible) return;
      controls.update();
      renderer.render(scene, camera);
    })();
    return { scene, camera, controls, renderer };
  }

  function radiusOf(obj) {
    const box = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(obj);
    return box.getBoundingSphere(new THREE.Sphere()).radius;
  }

  function centerAtOrigin(obj) {
    obj.updateMatrixWorld(true); // 载入后矩阵可能是过期的,先全量刷新再算包围盒
    const box = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(obj);
    const c = box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3());
    obj.position.sub(c);
    obj.updateMatrixWorld(true);
    return box.getBoundingSphere(new THREE.Sphere()).radius;
  }

  const COLORS = { steel: 0x8f979f };

  function initStl(holder) {
    const v = makeViewer(holder);
    if (!v) return;
    new STLLoader().load(
      holder.dataset.src,
      (geo) => {
        geo.computeVertexNormals();
        const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(geo, new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({
          color: COLORS[holder.dataset.color] || 0x9aa2ad, metalness: 0.35, roughness: 0.5,
        }));
        v.scene.add(mesh);
        const r = centerAtOrigin(mesh);
        v.camera.position.set(r * 0.7, r * 0.55, r * 1.9);
        v.controls.target.set(0, 0, 0);
        v.camera.near = r / 100; v.camera.far = r * 40; v.camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
        holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-hint')?.remove();
      },
      undefined,
      () => { const h = holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-hint'); if (h) h.textContent = '模型加载失败。'; }
    );
  }

  // ---- GLB:按原始实体逐件分组,点击选中 ----
  function initGlb(holder) {
    const v = makeViewer(holder);
    if (!v) return;
    const canvas = holder.querySelector('canvas');
    const label = holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-label');
    const parts = [];
    new GLTFLoader().load(
      holder.dataset.src,
      (gltf) => {
        const root = gltf.scene;
        v.scene.add(root);
        const r = centerAtOrigin(root);
        root.updateMatrixWorld(true);
        if (location.search.includes('debug')) window.__wb = { parts, camera: v.camera, controls: v.controls, root, THREE };
        root.traverse((o) => {
          if (o.isMesh) {
            o.material = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({
              color: 0x9aa2ad, metalness: 0.35, roughness: 0.5,
              emissive: 0x000000, emissiveIntensity: 0.5,
            });
            parts.push(o);
          }
        });
        v.camera.position.set(r * 0.7, r * 0.55, r * 1.9);
        v.controls.target.set(0, 0, 0);
        v.camera.near = r / 100; v.camera.far = r * 40; v.camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
        holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-hint')?.remove();

        let selected = null;
        const ray = new THREE.Raycaster();
        const ptr = new THREE.Vector2();
        let downX = 0, downY = 0;
        if (location.search.includes('debug')) window.__wbPick = { n: 0, ptr: null, hit: null, parts: parts.length };
        canvas.addEventListener('pointerdown', (e) => { downX = e.clientX; downY = e.clientY; });
        canvas.addEventListener('pointerup', (e) => {
          try {
            if (Math.hypot(e.clientX - downX, e.clientY - downY) > 6) return; // 拖动不是点选
            v.controls.update(); // 隐藏标签页里 RAF 不跑:补一次 update 让相机朝向/矩阵就位
            v.scene.updateMatrixWorld(true);
            v.camera.updateMatrixWorld();
            const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
            ptr.x = ((e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width) * 2 - 1;
            ptr.y = -((e.clientY - rect.top) / rect.height) * 2 + 1;
            ray.setFromCamera(ptr, v.camera);
            const hit = ray.intersectObjects(parts, false)[0];
            if (location.search.includes('debug')) Object.assign(window.__wbPick, { n: window.__wbPick.n + 1, ptr: [ptr.x, ptr.y], hit: hit ? hit.object.name : null, cam: v.camera.position.toArray().map(Math.round) });
            if (selected) { selected.material.emissive.set(0x000000); selected = null; }
            if (hit) {
              selected = hit.object;
              selected.material.emissive.set(0x1c66d6);
              selected.material.emissiveIntensity = 0.55;
              if (label) {
                label.textContent = selected.name || '未命名零件';
                label.hidden = false;
              }
            } else if (label) {
              label.hidden = true;
            }
          } catch (err) {
            if (location.search.includes('debug')) window.__wbPick.err = String(err);
          }
        });
      },
      undefined,
      () => { const h = holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-hint'); if (h) h.textContent = '模型加载失败。'; }
    );
  }

  // ---- PCB 3D:蓝色板底 + KiCad 官方元器件模型 + 聚类阻容,三块板切换 ----
  const COMP_BASE = '/models/comps/';
  const wrlCache = {};
  function loadWrl(name) {
    if (!wrlCache[name]) {
      wrlCache[name] = new Promise((res, rej) => new VRMLLoader().load(COMP_BASE + name + '.wrl', res, undefined, rej));
    }
    return wrlCache[name];
  }

  // 摆放表:坐标 mm(板左上原,y 向下),r=绕 Y 旋转,s=整体缩放,len=排针裁长(mm)。
  // 位置来自钻孔层(排针/端子的孔位)和顶层助焊膏聚类(贴片件),不是手估。
  const PCBS = {
    mcu51: {
      w: 70, h: 40,
      tex: '/images/workbench/pcb3d-mcu51-tex.png', json: '/models/pcb3d-mcu51.json',
      parts: [
        { m: 'LQFP-100_14x14mm_P0.5mm', x: 39.6, y: 21.5, s: 0.72 },
        { m: 'USB_Mini-B_Lumberg_2486_01_Horizontal', x: 6.2, y: 25.5, r: 90, len: 9.7 },
        { m: 'SW_PUSH_6mm', x: 12.4, y: 27.5, s: 0.65 },
        { m: 'SW_PUSH_6mm', x: 19.2, y: 10.2, s: 0.55 },
        { m: 'Crystal_HC49-U-3Pin_Vertical', x: 24.9, y: 19, s: 0.35 },
        { m: 'CP_Radial_D8.0mm_P3.50mm', x: 54, y: 17.9, s: 0.55 },
        { m: 'CP_Radial_D8.0mm_P3.50mm', x: 54, y: 26.8, s: 0.55 },
        { m: 'LED_D5.0mm', x: 20.4, y: 16.1, s: 0.45 },
        { m: 'PinHeader_1x40_P2.54mm_Vertical', x: 39, y: 1.9, r: 0, len: 40.6 },
        { m: 'PinHeader_1x40_P2.54mm_Vertical', x: 33.6, y: 38, r: 0, len: 50.8 },
        { m: 'PinHeader_2x20_P2.54mm_Vertical', x: 65.4, y: 22.1, r: 90, len: 17.8 },
      ],
    },
    stm32: {
      w: 100, h: 80,
      tex: '/images/workbench/pcb3d-stm32-tex.png', json: '/models/pcb3d-stm32.json',
      parts: [
        { m: 'LQFP-100_14x14mm_P0.5mm', x: 52.9, y: 38.8 },
        { m: 'Crystal_HC49-U-3Pin_Vertical', x: 33.6, y: 62.3, r: 90, s: 0.8 },
        { m: 'SW_PUSH_6mm', x: 77.5, y: 17.2 },
        { m: 'SW_PUSH_6mm', x: 29.7, y: 16.1 },
        { m: 'USB_Mini-B_Lumberg_2486_01_Horizontal', x: 16.9, y: 4.8, r: 180 },
        { m: 'PinHeader_1x40_P2.54mm_Vertical', x: 36.2, y: 4.8, r: 0, len: 12 },
      ],
    },
    pcb1: {
      w: 100, h: 30,
      tex: '/images/workbench/pcb3d-pcb1-tex.png', json: '/models/pcb3d-pcb1.json',
      parts: [
        { m: 'USB_Mini-B_Lumberg_2486_01_Horizontal', x: 7.9, y: 15.5, r: 90 },
      ],
    },
  };

  // 剩余聚类 → 双色调阻容/芯片黑盒
  function buildPassives(group, comps, usedNear, W, H) {
    const bodyMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x2e3238, roughness: 0.4, metalness: 0.3 });
    const endMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0xb9c0c8, roughness: 0.3, metalness: 0.8 });
    const chipMat = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x191d22, roughness: 0.35, metalness: 0.25 });
    for (const c of comps) {
      if (usedNear.some((p) => Math.hypot(p.x - c.x, p.y - c.y) < 5)) continue;
      const cw = Math.max(c.w / 1000, 0.0008), ch = Math.max(c.h / 1000, 0.0008);
      const px = c.x / 1000 - W / 2, pz = c.y / 1000 - H / 2;
      if (c.w >= 5 && c.h >= 4) {
        // 大一点的贴片:黑色芯片体
        const box = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(cw, 0.0016, ch), chipMat);
        box.position.set(px, 0.0008 + 0.0016 / 2, pz);
        group.add(box);
        continue;
      }
      // 阻容:本体 + 两端金属
      const long = Math.max(cw, ch), short = Math.min(cw, ch);
      const body = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(cw * 0.62, 0.0006, ch * 0.9), bodyMat);
      body.position.set(px, 0.0008 + 0.0003, pz);
      group.add(body);
      const endG = new THREE.BoxGeometry(cw * 0.19, 0.0007, ch * 0.9);
      const e1 = new THREE.Mesh(endG, endMat);
      e1.position.set(px - cw * 0.4, 0.0008 + 0.00035, pz);
      const e2 = new THREE.Mesh(endG, endMat);
      e2.position.set(px + cw * 0.4, 0.0008 + 0.00035, pz);
      group.add(e1, e2);
      void long; void short;
    }
  }

  function initPcb(holder) {
    const v = makeViewer(holder);
    if (!v) return;
    const hint = holder.querySelector('.viewer3d-hint');
    const boardGroup = new THREE.Group();
    v.scene.add(boardGroup);
    const aniso = v.renderer.capabilities.getMaxAnisotropy();

    async function build(key) {
      const cfg = PCBS[key];
      const W = cfg.w / 1000, H = cfg.h / 1000, T = 0.0016;
      const [tex, data] = await Promise.all([
        new Promise((res, rej) => new THREE.TextureLoader().load(cfg.tex, res, undefined, rej)),
        fetch(cfg.json).then((r) => r.json()),
      ]);
      tex.colorSpace = THREE.SRGBColorSpace;
      tex.anisotropy = aniso;
      boardGroup.clear();

      const mask = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ color: 0x16457c, roughness: 0.65, metalness: 0.05 });
      const top = new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({ map: tex, roughness: 0.5, metalness: 0.15 });
      const mesh = new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(W, T, H), [mask, mask, top, mask, mask, mask]);
      boardGroup.add(mesh);

      // 元器件模型(KiCad 官方 WRL:mm 单位、经验系数 0.00254 才是真实米制尺寸)
      const used = [];
      for (const p of cfg.parts) {
        used.push(p);
        try {
          const scene = await loadWrl(p.m);
          // 关键:包围盒要在任何缩放之前、对 loader 原始对象取,否则拿到过期矩阵
          const rawBox = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(scene);
          const rawSize = rawBox.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()); // mm
          const rawLong = Math.max(rawSize.x, rawSize.y, rawSize.z);
          const sm = p.s || 1;
          let k = 0.00254 * sm;
          if (p.len) k = ((p.len / 1000) / (rawLong * 0.00254)) * 0.00254 * sm;
          const inst = scene.clone(true);
          inst.scale.set(k, k, k);
          inst.rotation.x = -Math.PI / 2; // 模型 Y-up 长/高排布 → 板面朝上
          const outer = new THREE.Group();
          outer.add(inst);
          outer.userData.isComp = true;
          outer.rotation.y = -(p.r || 0) * Math.PI / 180;
          outer.position.set(p.x / 1000 - W / 2, T / 2, p.y / 1000 - H / 2);
          boardGroup.add(outer);
        } catch (e) { /* 单个模型失败不阻塞整板 */ }
      }

      // 剩余聚类 → 阻容/芯片
      buildPassives(boardGroup, data.comps, used, W, H);

      if (location.search.includes('debug')) {
        boardGroup.updateMatrixWorld(true);
        window.__pcbBoxes = boardGroup.children
          .filter((o) => o.userData && o.userData.isComp)
          .map((o) => {
            const b = new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(o);
            const s = b.getSize(new THREE.Vector3()).multiplyScalar(1000);
            return { dx: +s.x.toFixed(1), dy: +s.y.toFixed(1), dz: +s.z.toFixed(1) };
          });
      }
      const r = centerAtOrigin(boardGroup);
      v.camera.position.set(r * 0.5, r * 1.9, r * 1.7);
      v.controls.target.set(0, 0, 0);
      v.camera.near = r / 100; v.camera.far = r * 40; v.camera.updateProjectionMatrix();
      hint?.remove();
    }
    build(holder.dataset.pcb).catch(() => { if (hint) hint.textContent = '加载失败。'; });

    // tab 按钮在 .viewer3d-head 里,是 holder 的兄弟节点——从卡片容器找
    const card = holder.closest('.viewer3d-card') || document;
    card.querySelectorAll('[data-pcb-tab]').forEach((btn) => {
      btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        card.querySelectorAll('[data-pcb-tab]').forEach((b) => b.classList.remove('is-active'));
        btn.classList.add('is-active');
        build(btn.dataset.pcbTab);
      });
    });
  }

  function bind() {
    const nolazy = location.search.includes('nolazy'); // 渲染探针:隐藏标签页 IO 不触发,测试用直通参数
    document.querySelectorAll('[data-viewer]').forEach((holder) => {
      if (holder.dataset.vBound) return;
      holder.dataset.vBound = '1';
      const kind = holder.dataset.viewer;
      const init = kind === 'pcb' ? initPcb : kind === 'glb' ? initGlb : initStl;
      const start = () => init(holder);
      if (nolazy) { start(); return; }
      // 进入视口再初始化,省显存
      const io = new IntersectionObserver((es) => {
        if (es.some((e) => e.isIntersecting)) {
          io.disconnect();
          start();
        }
      }, { rootMargin: '120px' });
      io.observe(holder);
    });
  }
  bind();
  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', bind);
</script>
</Base>
